Package: unzzz
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), adduser, alsa-utils
Recommends: mpv
Maintainer: unzzz maintainers <unzzz@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: lightweight alarm clock with shared wake-up challenges
 unzzz is a small server-side alarm clock for a household, Raspberry Pi or
 LAN server. Standard alarms stop from the panel. Challenge alarms send each
 selected person a shortlink; the sound stops after everyone answers (or after
 a configured number of correct answers). It includes a web control panel,
 multiple challenge types, QR codes, uploaded music, special-day calendars and
 a scheduler that survives restarts.
 .
 No cloud account or external Python package is required.
